recommend keep-going the loop restarts on the Caravan lift arc with the wall standing. Next head by realized fall is may_pass at 51 rungs by 19 lines, though a six-line signature holds its return to fifty times eleven -- hash its bodies first, since note_path proved the queue's rung count is a floor rather than the family; hand_path at 34 by 27 and seat_the_ground at 43 by 21 both give back more per rung. Expect the wall to refuse a body or two early -- that is the rule working, and the message stays on disk. The named second door is a rules-consolidation survey over the 37 files in .claude/rules, which is the only always-on dial this pier has set as far as the regime that produced the reported review spirals.
